  "scope": "Current ceiling PSU and west-wall relay mounts read against the complete actual native back-top. Finite 3mm insert-wall and blind-floor witnesses follow each actual screw axis. Four relay pilot floors additionally read the printed flutes directly. The full-assembly contact screen and finite mating bands independently cover installed screws and inserts. Wiring is routed after the mechanical layout. Physical retention, spring force and purchased-board tolerances require the physical articles.",
